    "text": "The correct order of heat of combustion for following alkadienes is<br />\r<br />\r(i)&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0107_1b0f083ad8c9.jpg\" style=\"width: 166px; height: 89px;\" /><br />\r(ii)&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0107_33d3375f1abc.jpg\" style=\"width: 158px; height: 67px;\" /><br />\r(iii)&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0107_8a57e7bb1dc6.jpg\" style=\"width: 134px; height: 50px;\" />"
